RefineryRelay is installed.

Next steps:
  1. Run `bin/rails db:migrate`.
  2. Open Refinery admin and select “Relay Settings” in the sidebar.
  3. Enter the Relay chat URL and chat token, select the content sources, and save.
  4. Generate a bearer token and copy the feed endpoint into Relay's HTTP feed source.

Backend API endpoints:
  GET  /refinery_relay/api/relay/chat/availability
  POST /refinery_relay/api/relay/chat
  GET  /refinery_relay/api/relay/documents

The installer can be run again safely.
